Z||000008||fierofreek2001||04-12-2001||08:14 PM||||dave, in your old signature for the forum, you have a pic of a white gt with a bra on it, i own an identical gt and was thinking about a bra for shows and all, ... what bra was it? where is it from?<BR>my email is fierosam@aol.com<BR>thanks<BR>steve||||reg||1
Z||000009||Fierodave2001||04-12-2001||11:45 PM||||Here's a photo of the one I used made by Wolf<BR>avaible at discount auto for 'bout 82 dollars<P>It is made very very good.  Soft on the paint side.  I drove 200 miles to Daytona with it, and it left no marks on the paint.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Daytona_bra.jpg">  <BR>The hook up was very easy.  I'm sure it save me from many chips.<P>Lebra make one, but it's not as good.<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierofreek2001:<BR><B>dave, in your old signature for the forum, you have a pic of a white gt with a bra on it, i own an identical gt and was thinking about a bra for shows and all, ... what bra was it? where is it from?<BR>my email is fierosam@aol.com<BR>thanks<BR>steve</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><p>[This message has been edited by Fierodave2001 (edited 04-13-2001).]||||reg||6
