Z||000012||tgowens||04-13-2001||08:29 PM||||<B>Fierodave2001</B>, I have a Blue '87GT, a Gold '87GT and a Med. Red Metallic '87GT (along with a White '88 coupe and a Red '88 Coupe) (if you were asking me what color I had - if you were asking Ross then I apologize for jumping ahead of him!)<P><B>fierofreek2001</B>, I'm afraid that you have Fierodave2001 of Florida confused with FieroDave of Wisconsin.........he had a white GT in his signature with a LeBra on it......(I made the signature for him..)<BR><P>------------------<BR>My Fiero Web Site.....<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tgowens.gif">         </A><P>87 GT - Gold automatic<BR>87 GT - Blue automatic<BR>87 GT - Med. Red Met. 5-speed Getrag||||reg||1
Z||000013||Fierodave2001||04-13-2001||09:05 PM||||I thought you might of had me mixed up. <P>Anyway, hope the information helped about<BR>the Bra.  I let it sit out in the sun first,<BR>to get the leather hot, so it would be easy<BR>to put on.  It almost takes 2 to put it on.<P>The fit is just right.<P>The gold one looks good.  How rare is the gold color ?<P>[QUOTE]Originally posted by tgowens:<BR><B>[b]Fierodave2001</B>, I have a Blue '87GT, a Gold '87GT and a Med. Red Metallic '87GT (along with a White '88 coupe and a Red '88 Coupe) ||||reg||1
